{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/ee65c1be8376a4b18ab212dfd54e967f.avif?t=1773341752\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the farm you inherited from your grandmother\u2014a devoted cat lover. Once a true haven for cats, the farm has fallen into decline over time. Now it\u2019s your chance to restore its former glory </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This idle game in the &quot;Tamagotchi&quot; genre offers you more than just farm management\u2014you'll need to take care of each cat as if it were your beloved pet. Clean up the farm, repair damages, upgrade the cat house, and purchase rare breeds that produce more fur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cat needs daily feeding and affection\u2014neglect them, and they may grow sad, stop producing fur, or even fall ill. Expand your farm by unlocking new lands and gaining access to new types of cats. Make sure every pet finds a loving home and proper care! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/2399afc74f5ff2fe5cc24813ab387dda.avif?t=1773341752\" width=1260 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 150 unique cats, each with its own appearance and personality. You can collect the rarest and most charming pets from all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/7ca78aa1c33436b698c9c2cb3bdb3183.poster.avif?t=1773341752\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/7ca78aa1c33436b698c9c2cb3bdb3183.webm?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/7ca78aa1c33436b698c9c2cb3bdb3183.mp4?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/1607064a51bae8bcaebc02a4f3da6758.avif?t=1773341752\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras_big/1607064a51bae8bcaebc02a4f3da6758.avif?t=1773341752 width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your pets daily: feed and love them and give them attention. If you ignore their needs, they\u2019ll become unhappy, may fall ill, and will stop producing fur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/19caf004ed45761895c437162c58df66.poster.avif?t=1773341752\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/19caf004ed45761895c437162c58df66.webm?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/19caf004ed45761895c437162c58df66.mp4?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/4fd3fa81523b3c4ab687d8532fd184f3.avif?t=1773341752\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras_big/4fd3fa81523b3c4ab687d8532fd184f3.avif?t=1773341752 width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your pets into true fashion icons! In the game, you can purchase various outfits and accessories to dress up your cats as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/02e265e4c71118d5bf2d914022d3024e.poster.avif?t=1773341752\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/02e265e4c71118d5bf2d914022d3024e.webm?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/02e265e4c71118d5bf2d914022d3024e.mp4?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/f89ed04726407fe14fd7ca9b0afb7e29.avif?t=1773341752\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras_big/f89ed04726407fe14fd7ca9b0afb7e29.avif?t=1773341752 width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new farm locations around the world! Each new area not only expands your territory but also grants access to unique cat breeds to add to your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/86c105ea47a9152e6caed9739d82f591.poster.avif?t=1773341752\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/86c105ea47a9152e6caed9739d82f591.webm?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/86c105ea47a9152e6caed9739d82f591.mp4?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/0a8ebfbf6ae55764199ae06ac5bd8221.avif?t=1773341752\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras_big/0a8ebfbf6ae55764199ae06ac5bd8221.avif?t=1773341752 width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of the farm and clean up the trash, fix breakdowns, and maintain order. Upgrade your farm, upgrade various upgrades to get more wool and delight your cats with new amenities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/75510799ea6cc5c9278d0c2599abb412.poster.avif?t=1773341752\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/75510799ea6cc5c9278d0c2599abb412.webm?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488840/extras/75510799ea6cc5c9278d0c2599abb412.mp4?t=1773341752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tidy Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488840/a69d289c45e15c44bca88803d91e2785075ac8f2.jpg"},{"name":"First Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488840/1be4811df8dd65a35e5c95984fea51857dc53fb0.jpg"},{"name":"Daily Starter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488840/2055c51eea776c2ae7a869b491161a6f1a8111df.jpg"},{"name":"Fur Shipment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488840/d9231b838b0291b66e08f3a67faf1f8564bf462b.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrade Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488840/21c5c964209064f26908443fbf04f54253b05f75.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrade Enthu